:INFO
Art. 42 Storage
Articles 57 and 62 of the ChemO apply mutatis mutandis to the storage of biocidal products.
|

:NOTE
Art. 42 — Amended by No I of the O of 5 June 2015, in force since 1 July 2015 (AS 2015 1985).
