:INFO
Art. 43 Supply
1 For the supply of biocidal products, the following apply:
a. the terms of the ruling referred to in Article 20;
b. Articles 58, 59 and 63–66 of the ChemO mutatis mutandis.
2 For biocidal products that meet the criteria specified in Article 11d letter a, Article 64 paragraph 1, Article 65 paragraph 1 and Article 66 paragraph 1 letter a of the ChemO apply mutatis mutandis.
|

:NOTE
Art. 43 — Amended by No I of the O of 5 June 2015, in force since 1 July 2015 (AS 2015 1985).
Para. 1 let. b — [AS 2005 2721; 2007 821; 2009 401, 805; 2010 5223; 2011 5227; 2012 6103, 6659; 2013 201, 2673, 3041 No I 3; 2014 2073 Annex 11 No 1, 3857. AS 2015 1903 Art. 91]. See now: the O of 5 June 2015 (SR 813.11).
Para. 2 — Amended by No I of the O of 31 Jan. 2018, in force since 1 March 2018 (AS 2018 817).
